{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓籍啦啦隊女神李多慧近日趁工作空檔快閃香港旅遊，期間罕有改頭換面以全新破格造型現身街頭。她不僅以一身性感裝扮大 …</p><p></p>\n<p>韓籍啦啦隊女神李多慧近日趁工作空檔快閃香港旅遊，期間罕有改頭換面以全新破格造型現身街頭。她不僅以一身性感裝扮大曬零贅肉螞蟻腰，更罕有露出平時極少見身體部位。這輯夜遊香港街頭打卡照曝光後瞬間吸引逾7.2萬人朝聖，令人完全認不出照片中人。</p>\n<h2>李多慧快閃香港展現極致成熟魅力</h2>\n<p>李多慧日前抵達香港四處遊玩打卡，從黃昏一路拍攝到繁華夜景之中。她在街頭捨棄了一貫甜美打扮，換上一襲酒紅色短身背心並配搭同色系外套，隨性半露香肩之餘更完美展現出緊實馬甲線與纖幼螞蟻腰。下半身配搭黑色長裙並戴上銀框太陽眼鏡，在五光十色霓虹燈光影交織下散發出陣陣冷艷氣場，整個畫面充滿濃厚電影感。</p>\n<h2>親自發布夜遊照片派福利引發轟動</h2>\n<p>即使平時工作行程滿檔，李多慧依然非常用心經營社交平台並積極與粉絲互動。她前日親自將這批極具風格香港街頭遊玩照片上載至個人Instagram帳號與大眾分享。相片不僅紀錄了她於香港大街小巷穿梭愉快時光，更將她有別於過往形象成熟一面完全展露人前，迅速吸引大量網民湧入點讚及熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>李多慧告別招牌空氣劉海露精緻V臉</h2>\n<p>過去赴台發展3年期間，李多慧絕大部分時間皆以柔順長直髮配搭韓式空氣劉海作為個人標誌亮相。這回她卻罕有大膽改變造型，將一頭長髮俐落整齊地向後紮起，完全告別招牌劉海並徹底露出光潔額頭。這個全新髮型令她極致精緻五官與V字鵝蛋臉毫無保留地呈現出來，不但帶來強烈視覺反差，更為整體觀感增添幾分清爽與利落。</p>\n<h2>大批網民震驚留言狂讚女神判若兩人</h2>\n<p>破格靚相曝光後短短時間內便極速累積逾7.2萬個讚好，大批粉絲湧入留言區洗版式狂讚。不少人對於其氣質變化感到驚艷，紛紛激動留言表示「多慧這髮型簡直換了一個人，但一樣好可愛啊」、「好不一樣的多慧」以及「到哪都像在拍廣告，太美了我的公主」。更有網民高度評價她這次蛻變，直指「這妝髮很有港星感覺」，認為她無論轉換任何風格都能夠完美駕馭。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550559928447049_2344701796b053dc0df84d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315353792968723_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550559928447049_2344701796b053dc0df84d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560452555583_15198261296b053dc50abde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315357559455946_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560452555583_15198261296b053dc50abde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/saveclip.app_484873290_18494106028045342_8070109567903030075_n_146874013167dd4283580c4-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李多慧 （圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/saveclip.app_484873290_18494106028045342_8070109567903030075_n_146874013167dd4283580c4-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560720374697_14707581736b053dc7b19fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李多慧 （圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560720374697_14707581736b053dc7b19fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560873267599_5379632796b053dc943439.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"le_dahye_1795267160_4035315316874661575_642221341.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550560873267599_5379632796b053dc943439.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%95%a6%e5%95%a6%e9%9a%8a%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">啦啦隊女神</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e5%a4%9a%e6%85%a7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李多慧</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港旅遊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549323\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.872477+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1248,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:33:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:57:23.445234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:21.811014+00:00","content_hash":"0ab081bdc6c83d813d4cf1d5e9b83620b2c092d6dfe9f9a7296d7fe54662a758","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}